"""
Statistical analysis for post-hoc explanation calibration experiments.

Produces:
    1. experiment_A_correlations.csv
       EBSE <-> GPT perceived uncertainty
       Spearman rho + p + bootstrap 95% CI

    2. experiment_B_justification.csv
       Correct vs incorrect support scores
       Means, support gap, Mann-Whitney U,
       rank-biserial effect size + bootstrap 95% CI

    3. experiment_C1_pairing_qc.csv
       Mandatory Joint/Post-hoc same-question validation

    4. experiment_C1_joint_vs_posthoc.csv
       Joint vs Post-hoc correlations
       paired bootstrap Delta rho + 95% CI

    5. experiment_C1_aggregate.csv
       Aggregate Wilcoxon signed-rank test across
       model-dataset Delta rho values

IMPORTANT:
    Experiment C1 will NOT compare Joint and Post-hoc unless
    they contain exactly the same question set.

Usage:
    python statistical_analysis.py /path/to/results

Optional:
    python statistical_analysis.py /path/to/results \
        --output_dir stats_results \
        --n_boot 10000 \
        --seed 42
"""

